### P-01 Live request view (police) - all
GET {{host}}/api/police/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### P-01 Filter by status and priority
GET {{host}}/api/police/requests?status=PENDING&priority=urgent
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### P-01 Filter by time range
GET {{host}}/api/police/requests?from=2025-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### P-01 Invalid query param -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/police/requests?status=INVALID_STATUS
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### P-01 Role guard: senior cannot access -> 403
GET {{host}}/api/police/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}

### E-02 List emergency events (police)
GET {{host}}/api/police/emergency-events
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### E-02 Filter logged events
GET {{host}}/api/police/emergency-events?status=LOGGED
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### E-03 Review emergency event (mark REVIEWED)
PATCH {{host}}/api/police/emergency-events/{{emergencyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "REVIEWED"
}

### E-03 Already reviewed -> 409
PATCH {{host}}/api/police/emergency-events/{{emergencyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "REVIEWED"
}